Package: chainlink
Type: Package
Title: Chain-Linked Price and Volume Measures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
   person("Alain", "Quartier-la-Tente", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                 email = "alain.quartier@yahoo.fr",
                 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7890-3857")))
Description: Tools to derive price and volume measures of national accounts
    following chapter 8 of the International Monetary Fund (2018) "Quarterly
    National Accounts Manual (2017 Edition)" <doi:10.5089/9781475589870.069>:
    Laspeyres-type, Paasche-type and Fisher-type volume indices,
    chain-linking of quarterly or monthly volume indices with the annual
    overlap and the one-quarter overlap techniques, exact contributions to
    percent change of the chain-linked volume measures, and non-additivity of
    the chain-linked series. The benchmarking of the quarterly series on
    annual data can be done with the 'tempdisagg' package.
URL: https://github.com/AQLT/chainlink, https://aqlt.github.io/chainlink/
BugReports: https://github.com/AQLT/chainlink/issues
